file as committed). Add to "sets", in name order:

    {
      "command": "node benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-preview.mjs --tree <tree>",
      "fileCount": 1,
      "manifest": "office-preview/MANIFEST.json",
      "manifestSha256": "56fb2b2172939706d5906c63a67d63ec244f2062c6904a42b7646ea289706033",
      "recorder": "benchmarks/rust-core/recorders/record-office-preview.mjs",
